# PhishShield Platform — Phishing Detection Engine

PhishShield is an end-to-end URL threat analyzer and machine learning detection platform[cite: 1, 9]. The system extracts structural and lexical patterns, calculates string entropy, runs a Random Forest classifier in memory, and visualizes results via an interactive dashboard.

---

## Complete Project Architecture & Directory Layout

To run the application without path errors, arrange your files in the following exact directory structure:

```text
phishshield/
│
├── .vscode/
│   ├── launch.json          # VS Code Uvicorn run & debug configuration
│   └── settings.json        # Python virtual environment configuration
│
├── static/
│   └── index.html           # Dark-mode dashboard frontend UI
│
├── .env                     # Server host and port configuration
├── extractor.py             # Feature engineering & Shannon entropy engine
├── main.py                  # FastAPI server, ML training, & API endpoints
├── requirements.txt         # Dependencies list
└── README.md                # Documentation & lifecycle reference